# Title: Suspicious Electron Application Child Processes
# ID: f26eb764-fd89-464b-85e2-dc4a8e6e77b8
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-10-21
# Tags: attack.execution
# Description: Detects suspicious child processes of electron apps (teams, discord, slack, etc.). This could be a potential sign of ".asar" file tampering (See reference section for more information) or binary execution proxy through specific CLI arguments (see related rule)
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((process.parent.executable:*\\chrome.exe OR process.parent.executable:*\\discord.exe OR process.parent.executable:*\\GitHubDesktop.exe OR process.parent.executable:*\\keybase.exe OR process.parent.executable:*\\msedge.exe OR process.parent.executable:*\\msedgewebview2.exe OR process.parent.executable:*\\msteams.exe OR process.parent.executable:*\\slack.exe OR process.parent.executable:*\\teams.exe)) AND (((process.executable:*\\cmd.exe OR process.executable:*\\cscript.exe OR process.executable:*\\mshta.exe OR process.executable:*\\powershell.exe OR process.executable:*\\pwsh.exe OR process.executable:*\\regsvr32.exe OR process.executable:*\\whoami.exe OR process.executable:*\\wscript.exe)) OR ((process.executable:*:\\ProgramData\\* OR process.executable:*:\\Temp\\* OR process.executable:*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\* OR process.executable:*\\Users\\Public\\* OR process.executable:*\\Windows\\Temp\\*))) AND NOT ((process.parent.executable:*\\Discord.exe AND process.executable:*\\cmd.exe AND process.command_line:*\\NVSMI\\nvidia-smi.exe*)))
